# B8 - M6: Rate Limiting
# Requisito: levantar el perfil patched en el puerto 3001.
#   .\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run "-Dspring-boot.run.profiles=patched"
# Limite: 5 intentos por IP cada 60 segundos.
# El sexto intento debe responder HTTP 429.

@safe = http://localhost:3001

### 1. Primer intento: debe responder 401
POST {{safe}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "maria", "password": "incorrecta"}

### 2. Segundo intento: debe responder 401
POST {{safe}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "maria", "password": "incorrecta"}

### 3. Tercer intento: debe responder 401
POST {{safe}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "maria", "password": "incorrecta"}

### 4. Cuarto intento: debe responder 401
POST {{safe}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "maria", "password": "incorrecta"}

### 5. Quinto intento: debe responder 401
POST {{safe}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "maria", "password": "incorrecta"}

### 6. Sexto intento: debe responder 429
POST {{safe}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "maria", "password": "incorrecta"}